      "properties": {"Node name for S&R": "Note"},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Grass / ground TILE pipeline\n\nCheckpoint: sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors\nLoRA: pixel-art-xl.safetensors (weight 1.0)\nSettings: 1024x1024, 25 steps, CFG 5, dpmpp_2m + karras\n\nTile rules: NO background key, NO trim, NO outline.\nPixel Art XL is tuned for 8x nearest downscale: 1024 -> 128px (best),\nor 16x -> 64px (the mossy look used in the project).\nQuantize to 6-12 colors for the Into the Breach flat look.\n\nSEAMS: the GUI graph alone cannot wrap. Run the saved image through:\n  tools/pixelize.py in.png out.png --size 64 --colors 6 --tile --seamless\nIt offsets by half, heals the seam cross, rolls back (look unchanged).\ntools/gen_asset.py --tile does this automatically.\n\nAutomated:\npython tools/gen_asset.py 'lush green grass' --out assets/tiles/grass.png --size 64 --colors 6 --tile"
      ]
    },
